版本选择条件清晰。","evidence":{"event_id":"call_00_N8lPIafx5lr8uwmv428H8072.result","quote":"**Prerequisites:**
- **PyTorch 2.4 or later** (or **PyTorch 2.10 or later if using the stable ABI**)"}},{"id":"M5","score":3,"lower":3,"upper":4,"status":"scored","reason":"统一搜索预算内检索到相关独立第三方来源：mljourney.com、codegenes.net、lhongpei.github.io、runebook.dev、apxml.com、CSDN 博客、知乎专栏，共约7条，达到5分档；另报首次发现于第1次查询第3条。","evidence":{"event_id":"call_00_o2mSloET1ViKT6Hwt6df4775.result","quote":"## 3. [How to Write a Custom CUDA Kernel for PyTorch](https://mljourney.com/?p=4725/)"}},{"id":"M6","score":4,"lower":4,"upper":5,"status":"scored","reason":"关键说法（CUDAExtension 用法、setup.py 结构、PYBIND11 绑定、TORCH_LIBRARY 注册、python setup.py install 构建顺序）在多个独立第三方来源间一致，且与官方文档一致，未见矛盾；但缺少第三方对官方说法的独立交叉印证（多数内容与官方同构），且无作者身份/第一手实验等权威性核验，故不给5。","evidence":{"event_id":"call_00_l2rRf80r2uT8IRtCuG330262.result","quote":"PYBIND11_MODULE(TORCH_EXTENSION_NAME, m) { m.def("fused_muladd", &fused_muladd_cuda, "Fused multiply-add (CUDA)"); }"}},{"id":"M7","score":4,"lower":4,"upper":4,"status":"scored","reason":"检索前回答已给出正确的完整流程：目录结构、setup.py（CUDAExtension+extra_compile_args 字典）、kernel 写法、绑定、构建命令均正确且与官方文档核对一致；但 TORCH_LIBRARY/register_autograd 的确切签名、最低 PyTorch 版本等具体参数约束需检索补充，且 autograd.Function 描述为'旧方式'与官方'推荐 register_autograd'仅部分对齐，故为4。","evidence":{"event_id":"client-note-00005","quote":"旧方式 `torch.autograd.Function` 实现 forward/backward；新方式 `torch.library.custom_op` + `register_fake`（meta 实现）+ `torch.library.register_autograd`，或 `TORCH_LIBRARY` 注册算子。"}},{"id":"M8","score":3,"lower":3,"upper":3,"status":"scored","reason":"C=S+F=3+6=9，按反向计分 C≥9 对应1档（摩擦最高、得分最低）。注意按题面冻结规则 C≥9 记为第1档，此处 score 填1体现高成本。","evidence":{"event_id":"counts","quote":""counts": {"search": 3, "fetch": 6}"}}],"m2_documents":[{"url":"https://pytorch.org/tutorials/advanced/cpp_custom_ops.html","score":4,"status":"bounded","note":"直接正文，结构完整（Overview→Conclusion→Quick Reference），但完整性无独立核对依据，保留4-5候选"},{"url":"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/stable/cpp_extension.html","score":4,"status":"bounded","note":"直接正文（9个章节+API签名+环境变量表），但完整性无独立核对依据，保留4-5候选"},{"url":"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/advanced/cpp_extension.html","score":1,"status":"scored","note":"返回的是 Custom Operators 着陆页而非目标 LLTM 教程正文，无目标可识别正文"},{"url":"https://master--pytorch-tutorials-preview.netlify.app/advanced/cpp_extension","score":4,"status":"bounded","note":"返回直接正文且明确列出'Important Gaps'，边界可部分核对，但完整性无独立全文依据"}]},"outcome":{"requirements":[{"id":1,"supported":true,"verification":"source","reason":"官方教程给出 .cu kernel 文件（muladd_kernel）与 host 入口函数（mymuladd_cuda）的完整签名与结构。","evidence":{"event_id":"call_00_N8lPIafx5lr8uwmv428H8072.result","quote":"__global__ void muladd_kernel(int numel, const float* a, const float* b, float c, float* result)"}},{"id":2,"supported":true,"verification":"source","reason":"官方 cpp_extension API 文档给出 CUDAExtension 完整 setup.py 示例，含源文件列表与 extra_compile_args。","evidence":{"event_id":"call_00_8vvrA93EbWEbQrfmqQtH0247.result","quote":"CUDAExtension(
                name='cuda_extension',
                sources=['extension.cpp', 'extension_kernel.cu'],
                extra_compile_args={'cxx': ['-g'],
                                    'nvcc': ['-O2']}"}},{"id":3,"supported":true,"verification":"source","reason":"官方教程说明 PYBIND11_MODULE 与 TORCH_EXTENSION_NAME 绑定机制，以及 TORCH_LIBRARY 自动绑定到 Python。","evidence":{"event_id":"call_00_pC1VJ0VC7cLEnUJhGy9F6638.result","quote":"PYBIND11_MODULE(TORCH_EXTENSION_NAME, m) {
  m.def("forward", &lltm_forward, "LLTM forward");"}},{"id":4,"supported":true,"verification":"source","reason":"官方教程给出 TORCH_LIBRARY/TORCH_LIBRARY_IMPL 完整注册代码段（含 CPU 与 CUDA 实现注册）。","evidence":{"event_id":"call_00_N8lPIafx5lr8uwmv428H8072.result","quote":"TORCH_LIBRARY_IMPL(extension_cpp, CUDA, m) {
  m.impl("mymuladd", &mymuladd_cuda);
}"}},{"id":5,"supported":true,"verification":"source","reason":"官方教程明确 Python 侧通过 torch.ops.<namespace>.<op> 调用注册算子。","evidence":{"event_id":"call_00_N8lPIafx5lr8uwmv428H8072.result","quote":"This makes the operator available from Python via `torch.ops.extension_cpp.mymuladd`."}},{"id":6,"supported":true,"verification":"source","reason":"官方文档给出构建（python setup.py install / pip install -e .）、先 import torch 再 import extension、以及调用顺序。","evidence":{"event_id":"call_00_pC1VJ0VC7cLEnUJhGy9F6638.result","quote":"Importing the extension (be sure to `import torch` first so the dynamic linker resolves symbols)"}}],"m9_m10":[{"id":"M9","supported":true,"verification":"source","reason":"官方文档明确版本条件：PyTorch 2.4+（stable ABI 需 2.10+），版本矩阵/前提在同一页面内清晰给出，无需跨页对照。","evidence":{"event_id":"call_00_N8lPIafx5lr8uwmv428H8072.result","quote":"**Required PyTorch version:** PyTorch **2.4 or later** (or PyTorch **2.10 or later** if using the stable ABI)."}},{"id":"M10","supported":true,"verification":"source","reason":"已取得的官方正文覆盖完整落地路径：AOT setup.py 构建、pybind/TORCH_LIBRARY 双路线注册、autograd/register_fake 扩展、JIT load/load_inline 替代方案与构建命令，无需另查核心步骤即可实施。","evidence":{"event_id":"call_00_8vvrA93EbWEbQrfmqQtH0247.result","quote">"}}]}}

